title: "CertMalConv: Efficient and Certifiably Robust Deep Learning for Multi-modal Malware Detection and Classification"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, trained-model checkpoints, verification harness
  and experimental scripts for CertMalConv, a multi-modal malware detector
  whose malicious verdicts carry a deterministic certificate against coupled
  problem-space edits.
